### Login
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@companycloud.com",
  "password": "SecurePass123"
}

### Get companies
GET http://localhost:5000/api/companies
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN_HERE

### Create company
POST http://localhost:5000/api/companies
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN_HERE

{
  "companyName": "Sample Cloud Labs",
  "location": "Pune",
  "industry": "Cloud Services",
  "employeeCount": 75,
  "email": "hello@samplecloud.com",
  "website": "https://samplecloud.com",
  "contactNumber": "9090909090"
}

### Update company
PUT http://localhost:5000/api/companies/COMPANY_ID_HERE
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN_HERE

{
  "companyName": "Updated Cloud Labs"
}

### Delete company
DELETE http://localhost:5000/api/companies/COMPANY_ID_HERE
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN_HERE
